{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"图数据库查询性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/engineering/performance-optimization","wordCount":908,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"图数据库查询性能优化\">图数据库查询性能优化</h1><p>图数据库的性能优化与关系型数据库有显著差异。关系型数据库的优化核心是减少 JOIN 代价；而图数据库的优化核心是<strong>控制遍历范围</strong>——即在图遍历过程中尽早剪枝，避免加载不必要的节点和边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行计划（Execution Plan）</td>\n<td>查询引擎将查询编译成的物理操作树，决定实际执行策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NodeIndexSeek</td>\n<td>通过 B-Tree 或唯一索引定位节点，比全扫描快数量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>笛卡尔积（Cartesian Product）</td>\n<td>多个独立 MATCH 子句产生的行数爆炸，是最常见的性能陷阱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>db hits</td>\n<td>PROFILE 中的磁盘/缓存访问次数，是优化的核心指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尽早过滤原则</td>\n<td>WHERE 条件和 WITH 子句应尽量靠前放，减少中间行数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIMIT 早停</td>\n<td>可变长路径配合 LIMIT 在找到足够结果后提前终止遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页面缓存命中率</td>\n<td>应维持在 99% 以上，低于 95% 需增加内存配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"理解查询执行模型\">理解查询执行模型</h2><p>图数据库的查询执行通常分为三个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[查询解析\\nParsing] --&gt; B[逻辑计划生成\\nLogical Plan]&#10;    B --&gt; C[物理计划优化\\nPhysical Plan]&#10;    C --&gt; D[执行\\nExecution]&#10;    D --&gt; E[结果返回]\">graph LR\n    A[查询解析\\nParsing] --&gt; B[逻辑计划生成\\nLogical Plan]\n    B --&gt; C[物理计划优化\\nPhysical Plan]\n    C --&gt; D[执行\\nExecution]\n    D --&gt; E[结果返回]</pre><p><strong>逻辑计划</strong>：将查询的语义转化为关系代数操作（扫描、过滤、连接、投影）。</p>\n<p><strong>物理计划</strong>：选择具体的执行策略，包括索引选择、连接顺序、并行策略等。这是性能差异最大的阶段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用-explain-和-profile\">使用 EXPLAIN 和 PROFILE</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- EXPLAIN：显示计划但不执行，成本为 0&#10;EXPLAIN MATCH (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS*1..3]-&gt;(friends)&#10;RETURN friends.name&#10;&#10;-- PROFILE：实际执行并收集运行时统计&#10;PROFILE MATCH (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS*1..3]-&gt;(friends)&#10;RETURN friends.name\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- EXPLAIN：显示计划但不执行，成本为 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXPLAIN MATCH (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS*1..3]->(friends)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN friends.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- PROFILE：实际执行并收集运行时统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PROFILE MATCH (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS*1..3]->(friends)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN friends.name</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PROFILE 输出的关键指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>db hits</td>\n<td>磁盘/缓存访问次数</td>\n<td>越小越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rows</td>\n<td>该步骤产生的行数</td>\n<td>关注中间行数爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cache hits/misses</td>\n<td>页面缓存命中情况</td>\n<td>命中率越高越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>time</td>\n<td>该步骤耗时</td>\n<td>识别热点步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"索引策略\">索引策略</h2><h3 id=\"索引类型选择\">索引类型选择</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 1. B-Tree 索引（默认，适合等值查询和范围查询）&#10;CREATE INDEX person_age FOR (p:Person) ON (p.age)&#10;-- 加速: WHERE p.age = 30 / WHERE p.age &gt; 25 AND p.age &lt; 40&#10;&#10;-- 2. 复合索引（多属性，注意属性顺序）&#10;CREATE INDEX person_city_age FOR (p:Person) ON (p.city, p.age)&#10;-- 最左前缀原则：仅 WHERE p.city = &#39;Shanghai&#39; 可以利用该索引&#10;-- WHERE p.city = &#39;Shanghai&#39; AND p.age &gt; 25 效果更佳&#10;&#10;-- 3. 文本索引（前缀匹配）&#10;CREATE TEXT INDEX person_name_text FOR (p:Person) ON (p.name)&#10;-- 加速: WHERE p.name STARTS WITH &#39;Ali&#39;&#10;&#10;-- 4. 全文索引（复杂文本搜索）&#10;CREATE FULLTEXT INDEX movie_search FOR (m:Movie) ON EACH [m.title, m.synopsis]&#10;&#10;-- 5. 关系属性索引（Neo4j 5.x+）&#10;CREATE INDEX rel_follows_since FOR ()-[r:FOLLOWS]-() ON (r.since)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 1. B-Tree 索引（默认，适合等值查询和范围查询）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE INDEX person_age FOR (p:Person) ON (p.age)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 加速: WHERE p.age = 30 / WHERE p.age > 25 AND p.age &#x3C; 40</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 2. 复合索引（多属性，注意属性顺序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE INDEX person_city_age FOR (p:Person) ON (p.city, p.age)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 最左前缀原则：仅 WHERE p.city = 'Shanghai' 可以利用该索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- WHERE p.city = 'Shanghai' AND p.age > 25 效果更佳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 3. 文本索引（前缀匹配）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE TEXT INDEX person_name_text FOR (p:Person) ON (p.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 加速: WHERE p.name STARTS WITH 'Ali'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 4. 全文索引（复杂文本搜索）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE FULLTEXT INDEX movie_search FOR (m:Movie) ON EACH [m.title, m.synopsis]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 5. 关系属性索引（Neo4j 5.x+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE INDEX rel_follows_since FOR ()-[r:FOLLOWS]-() ON (r.since)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"约束隐式创建索引\">约束隐式创建索引</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 唯一约束自动创建唯一索引（比普通 B-Tree 索引更快）&#10;CREATE CONSTRAINT person_email FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE p.email IS UNIQUE&#10;-- 效果：WHERE p.email = &#39;alice@example.com&#39; 使用唯一扫描\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 唯一约束自动创建唯一索引（比普通 B-Tree 索引更快）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE CONSTRAINT person_email FOR (p:Person) REQUIRE p.email IS UNIQUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 效果：WHERE p.email = 'alice@example.com' 使用唯一扫描</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"索引使用诊断\">索引使用诊断</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 查看所有索引及其使用状态&#10;SHOW INDEXES YIELD name, type, state, populationPercent, labelsOrTypes, properties&#10;WHERE state = &#39;ONLINE&#39;&#10;RETURN name, type, labelsOrTypes, properties, populationPercent&#10;&#10;-- 检查索引是否被查询使用&#10;PROFILE MATCH (p:Person {email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39;})&#10;RETURN p&#10;-- 观察计划中是否出现 NodeUniqueIndexSeek 而非 NodeByLabelScan\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 查看所有索引及其使用状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SHOW INDEXES YIELD name, type, state, populationPercent, labelsOrTypes, properties</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE state = 'ONLINE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN name, type, labelsOrTypes, properties, populationPercent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 检查索引是否被查询使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PROFILE MATCH (p:Person {email: 'alice@example.com'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 观察计划中是否出现 NodeUniqueIndexSeek 而非 NodeByLabelScan</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"查询模式优化\">查询模式优化</h2><h3 id=\"优化一-提供锚点节点\">优化一：提供锚点节点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 差：两个独立 MATCH，产生笛卡尔积&#10;MATCH (a:Person)&#10;MATCH (b:Movie)&#10;RETURN a.name, b.title&#10;-- 产生 O(|Person| × |Movie|) 行&#10;&#10;-- 好：通过关系连接&#10;MATCH (a:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(b:Movie)&#10;RETURN a.name, b.title&#10;-- 只返回实际存在的 ACTED_IN 关系\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 差：两个独立 MATCH，产生笛卡尔积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (b:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN a.name, b.title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 产生 O(|Person| × |Movie|) 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 好：通过关系连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]->(b:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN a.name, b.title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 只返回实际存在的 ACTED_IN 关系</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"优化二-尽早过滤\">优化二：尽早过滤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 差：先展开再过滤&#10;MATCH (p:Person)-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(friend:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(movie:Movie)&#10;WHERE p.name = &#39;Alice&#39; AND movie.year &gt; 2015&#10;RETURN friend.name, movie.title&#10;&#10;-- 好：用 WITH 在中间阶段过滤&#10;MATCH (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(friend:Person)&#10;WITH friend  -- 先确定 friend，再展开 ACTED_IN&#10;MATCH (friend)-[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(movie:Movie)&#10;WHERE movie.year &gt; 2015&#10;RETURN friend.name, movie.title\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 差：先展开再过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person)-[:KNOWS]->(friend:Person)-[:ACTED_IN]->(movie:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE p.name = 'Alice' AND movie.year > 2015</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN friend.name, movie.title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 好：用 WITH 在中间阶段过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS]->(friend:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH friend  -- 先确定 friend，再展开 ACTED_IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (friend)-[:ACTED_IN]->(movie:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE movie.year > 2015</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN friend.name, movie.title</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"优化三-使用-limit-剪枝\">优化三：使用 LIMIT 剪枝</h3><p>对于 OPTIONAL MATCH 和可变长路径，LIMIT 可以在找到足够结果后停止遍历：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 可变长路径 + LIMIT 早停&#10;MATCH path = (start:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS*1..6]-&gt;(end:Person)&#10;WHERE end.name = &#39;Bob&#39;&#10;RETURN length(path) AS hops, [n IN nodes(path) | n.name] AS route&#10;LIMIT 1  -- 找到第一条路径即停止\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 可变长路径 + LIMIT 早停</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH path = (start:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS*1..6]->(end:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE end.name = 'Bob'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN length(path) AS hops, [n IN nodes(path) | n.name] AS route</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 1  -- 找到第一条路径即停止</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"优化四-避免-n-1-查询\">优化四：避免 N+1 查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- N+1 反模式（应用层循环查询）：&#10;-- Python: for person in persons: query(f&quot;MATCH (p {{name: &#39;{person}&#39;}})&quot;)&#10;&#10;-- 正确做法：单次批量查询&#10;MATCH (p:Person)&#10;WHERE p.name IN [&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;Bob&#39;, &#39;Charlie&#39;, &#39;David&#39;]&#10;OPTIONAL MATCH (p)-[:ACTED_IN]-&gt;(m:Movie)&#10;RETURN p.name, collect(m.title) AS movies\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- N+1 反模式（应用层循环查询）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Python: for person in persons: query(f\"MATCH (p {{name: '{person}'}})\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 正确做法：单次批量查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE p.name IN ['Alice', 'Bob', 'Charlie', 'David']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>OPTIONAL MATCH (p)-[:ACTED_IN]->(m:Movie)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN p.name, collect(m.title) AS movies</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"优化五-count-查询优化\">优化五：COUNT 查询优化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 差：返回所有节点再计数&#10;MATCH (p:Person)-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(f:Person)&#10;WHERE p.name = &#39;Alice&#39;&#10;RETURN count(f)&#10;&#10;-- 好：使用 count() 与 exists() 的谓词形式&#10;MATCH (p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})&#10;RETURN size([(p)-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(:Person) | 1]) AS friendCount&#10;-- 或在支持的版本中使用：&#10;RETURN [(p:Person {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:KNOWS]-&gt;(:Person) | 1] AS count\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 差：返回所有节点再计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person)-[:KNOWS]->(f:Person)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE p.name = 'Alice'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN count(f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 好：使用 count() 与 exists() 的谓词形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p:Person {name: 'Alice'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN size([(p)-[:KNOWS]->(:Person) | 1]) AS friendCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 或在支持的版本中使用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN [(p:Person {name: 'Alice'})-[:KNOWS]->(:Person) | 1] AS count</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内存与缓存管理\">内存与缓存管理</h2><h3 id=\"页面缓存-page-cache-配置\">页面缓存（Page Cache）配置</h3><p>Neo4j 将常用数据缓存在内存中。关键配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# neo4j.conf&#10;# 页面缓存大小（建议设为图数据文件总大小）&#10;server.memory.pagecache.size=4g&#10;&#10;# 堆内存（JVM 堆，用于查询处理）&#10;server.memory.heap.initial_size=1g&#10;server.memory.heap.max_size=4g\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># neo4j.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 页面缓存大小（建议设为图数据文件总大小）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server.memory.pagecache.size=4g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 堆内存（JVM 堆，用于查询处理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server.memory.heap.initial_size=1g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server.memory.heap.max_size=4g</span></span></code></pre></div><p>监控缓存命中率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"CALL dbms.queryJmx(&#39;org.neo4j:instance=kernel#0,name=Page cache&#39;)&#10;YIELD attributes&#10;RETURN attributes.HitRatio.value AS hitRatio&#10;-- 理想值 &gt; 0.99；低于 0.95 需要增加页面缓存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>CALL dbms.queryJmx('org.neo4j:instance=kernel#0,name=Page cache')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD attributes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN attributes.HitRatio.value AS hitRatio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 理想值 > 0.99；低于 0.95 需要增加页面缓存</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行内存\">执行内存</h3><p>复杂查询（排序、聚合、可变长路径）需要大量执行内存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 查询操作符内存限制&#10;dbms.memory.transaction.global_max_size=256m&#10;dbms.memory.transaction.max_size=16m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 查询操作符内存限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dbms.memory.transaction.global_max_size=256m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dbms.memory.transaction.max_size=16m</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发与锁\">并发与锁</h2><h3 id=\"读写分离\">读写分离</h3><p>Neo4j 因果集群（Causal Cluster）允许从副本节点读取，减少主节点压力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Java 驱动：路由读取到副本节点&#10;try (Session session = driver.session(SessionConfig.builder()&#10;        .withDatabase(&quot;neo4j&quot;)&#10;        .withDefaultAccessMode(AccessMode.READ)&#10;        .build())) {&#10;    // 此会话的读操作路由到副本&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Java 驱动：路由读取到副本节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Session session </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SessionConfig.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">builder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"neo4j\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withDefaultAccessMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AccessMode.READ)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 此会话的读操作路由到副本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"锁等待超时\">锁等待超时</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 避免长时间锁等待导致超时堆积&#10;dbms.lock.acquisition.timeout=10s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 避免长时间锁等待导致超时堆积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dbms.lock.acquisition.timeout=10s</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"批量操作优化\">批量操作优化</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 大批量写入：使用 UNWIND + 参数化&#10;UNWIND $batch AS row&#10;MERGE (p:Person {email: row.email})&#10;ON CREATE SET p.name = row.name, p.created = timestamp()&#10;ON MATCH SET p.lastSeen = timestamp()&#10;&#10;-- 批量关系创建&#10;UNWIND $rels AS rel&#10;MATCH (a:Person {id: rel.fromId}), (b:Person {id: rel.toId})&#10;MERGE (a)-[:KNOWS {since: rel.since}]-&gt;(b)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 大批量写入：使用 UNWIND + 参数化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>UNWIND $batch AS row</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MERGE (p:Person {email: row.email})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ON CREATE SET p.name = row.name, p.created = timestamp()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ON MATCH SET p.lastSeen = timestamp()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 批量关系创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>UNWIND $rels AS rel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:Person {id: rel.fromId}), (b:Person {id: rel.toId})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MERGE (a)-[:KNOWS {since: rel.since}]->(b)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>批量导入推荐使用 <code>neo4j-admin import</code>（离线工具）或 APOC 的 <code>apoc.periodic.iterate</code>（在线批量操作）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>图数据库查询优化的核心是「缩小遍历范围」：通过高选择性索引定位起点，通过早期过滤减少中间行数，通过 LIMIT 早停避免遍历不必要的路径，通过避免笛卡尔积防止行数爆炸。PROFILE 是诊断慢查询的最重要工具，重点观察 db hits 和中间行数。内存配置（页面缓存大小）是性能的最重要杠杆，对于图数据库来说，将常用数据完全装入内存能带来数量级的性能提升。批量操作应使用 UNWIND 参数化而非循环单条查询，大批量导入应使用 neo4j-admin 离线工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>Schema 设计模式：合理的建模是性能优化的前提</li>\n<li>Neo4j 工程实践：APOC 和 GDS 提供更多高级优化工具</li>\n<li>第二章引言：本章三个主题的结构关系和学习路径</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图数据库查询性能优化","id":"图数据库查询性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"理解查询执行模型","id":"理解查询执行模型"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 EXPLAIN 和 PROFILE","id":"使用-explain-和-profile"},{"level":2,"text":"索引策略","id":"索引策略"},{"level":3,"text":"索引类型选择","id":"索引类型选择"},{"level":3,"text":"约束隐式创建索引","id":"约束隐式创建索引"},{"level":3,"text":"索引使用诊断","id":"索引使用诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"查询模式优化","id":"查询模式优化"},{"level":3,"text":"优化一：提供锚点节点","id":"优化一-提供锚点节点"},{"level":3,"text":"优化二：尽早过滤","id":"优化二-尽早过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"优化三：使用 LIMIT 剪枝","id":"优化三-使用-limit-剪枝"},{"level":3,"text":"优化四：避免 N+1 查询","id":"优化四-避免-n-1-查询"},{"level":3,"text":"优化五：COUNT 查询优化","id":"优化五-count-查询优化"},{"level":2,"text":"内存与缓存管理","id":"内存与缓存管理"},{"level":3,"text":"页面缓存（Page Cache）配置","id":"页面缓存-page-cache-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"执行内存","id":"执行内存"},{"level":2,"text":"并发与锁","id":"并发与锁"},{"level":3,"text":"读写分离","id":"读写分离"},{"level":3,"text":"锁等待超时","id":"锁等待超时"},{"level":2,"text":"批量操作优化","id":"批量操作优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"图 Schema 设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/engineering/schema-design-patterns"},"next":{"title":"Neo4j 工程实践：Bolt、APOC 与 GDS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/engineering/neo4j-engineering"}}